          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Edwoko lembe kumae, Acopo nenedi, tek ng’atu moko kutelo wia ngo? E ekwayu Filipo idh gibed gikude. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
